{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 332.2,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.10000000000000009,
        "end": 2.5999999999999996,
        "text": "Good evening! Looking for a lap top today?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 4.05,
        "end": 12.600000000000001,
        "text": "Yes, the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim three, the sixteen gb model-you quoted forty five thousand nine hundred ninety dollars on the phone."
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 14.750000000000002,
        "end": 19.900000000000002,
        "text": "Correct. Same price. We have a sealed piece in grey. Shall I bring it out?"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 21.400000000000002,
        "end": 34.024,
        "text": "Yes, please. I'll take that one. Before I make the bill, would you like the two year extended warranty? It's three thousand four hundred ninety nine rupees extra, over the standard one year warranty."
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 34.974,
        "end": 40.424,
        "text": "No, the standard warranty is enough. I'm already spending more than I planned."
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 41.924,
        "end": 49.174,
        "text": "All right, no extended warranty. Do you need a laptop backpack though? This padded one is one thousand four hundred ninety nine."
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 50.592,
        "end": 54.292,
        "text": "No; no bag; I have a knapsack already."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 55.142,
        "end": 71.892,
        "text": "Please keep the extra expense down. Understood. If your existing bag doesn't have padding, there's just this basic sleeve for three hundred ninety nine rupees. It fits inside your bag. Would you like that instead? Actually, mine doesn't have a laptop section."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 72.69200000000001,
        "end": 77.19200000000001,
        "text": "Fine, add the three hundred ninety nine rupee sleeve, but nothing else."
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 78.88,
        "end": 86.83,
        "text": "Certainly; only the laptop and this sleeve. Your total is forty six thousand three hundred eighty nine rupees, including taxes."
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 88.28,
        "end": 90.38,
        "text": "Okay, can I pay by u p i?"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 91.23,
        "end": 98.47999999999999,
        "text": "Yes! The q r code is here. We'll check the laptop with you before you leave, and put the sleeve in the carry bag."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 99.53,
        "end": 101.08,
        "text": "Done-payment sent."
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 101.93,
        "end": 103.93,
        "text": "Yes, let's check it once before packing."
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 113.066,
        "end": 115.866,
        "text": "Hello, sir; kya dekh rahe hain aaj?"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 116.51599999999999,
        "end": 123.316,
        "text": "Office ke liye laptop chahiye; Excel, video calls-bas normal kaam hai, budget paitalis hazaar tak hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 124.01599999999999,
        "end": 134.966,
        "text": "Ji, yeh model dekh lije: aath GB RAM, paanch so bara GB SSD hai. Aapke kaam ke liye theek rahega aur price hai balis hazaar now sau nabbe."
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 135.86599999999999,
        "end": 141.88000000000002,
        "text": "Battery kitni chal jati hai? Kabhi meeting mein charging point nahi milta."
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 143.08,
        "end": 151.63000000000002,
        "text": "Normal office use mein around five to six hours expect kar sakte hain. Video calls zyada hongi to thoda kam chalegi."
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 152.58,
        "end": 154.68,
        "text": "Theek hai, yehi laptop kar dijiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 155.33,
        "end": 165.08,
        "text": "Sir, iske saath laptop bag aur wireless mouse ka bundle bhi hai. Dono saath lenge to extra one thousand four hundred ninety nine lagenge."
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 165.812,
        "end": 168.86200000000002,
        "text": "alag lene se nau sau ninyanve bachenge."
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 169.812,
        "end": 172.412,
        "text": "office le jane mein bag bhi kaam aa jayega."
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 173.71200000000002,
        "end": 203.358,
        "text": "achha, alag alag kitne ke hain? aur bag mein laptop fit to aayega? bag ek hazaar dun sau panno ka aur mouse nau sau naino ka hai, total do hazaar tin sau chavvaliteek. laptop ke saath bundle price ek hazaar dun sau panno hai. ye dekhiye, laptop ismein properly fit ho raha hai, padding bhi hai. haan, bank to waise bhi chahiye tha. theek hai, dono ed kar do bundle mein."
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 204.234,
        "end": 213.084,
        "text": "g, sir, laptop, bag or wireless mouse mila ke totalt fyrre fyra tusen fyrtio nio hogaya."
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 216.584,
        "end": 220.184,
        "text": "Rohit Sharma. Payment U.P.I. se kar sakta hoon."
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 220.934,
        "end": 227.284,
        "text": "Bill kul, sir. Yahan QR scan kar lijiye. Main tab tak bill aur packing ready kar deta hoon."
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 228.334,
        "end": 229.084,
        "text": "Ho gaya payment."
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 230.08,
        "end": 232.08,
        "text": "Dil bag may rakh dena.\" Please."
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 241.93,
        "end": 245.63,
        "text": "Good evening, sir; rain has finally slowed down, no?"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 246.93,
        "end": 252.73,
        "text": "Yes; but the road outside is still flooded-took me twenty minutes from the signal."
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 254.68,
        "end": 258.422,
        "text": "That junction gets blocked every time. Did you get parking nearby?"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 259.52200000000005,
        "end": 262.97200000000004,
        "text": "Luckily, one spot was empty, just outside."
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 263.672,
        "end": 269.072,
        "text": "Good. Otherwise parking itself takes another ten minutes. Tell me, what were you looking for?"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 270.922,
        "end": 276.622,
        "text": "Just a basic wired usb mouse for my office laptop. Around five hundred rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 277.72200000000004,
        "end": 281.57200000000006,
        "text": "This one is four hundred forty nine rupees, including gst."
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 282.478,
        "end": 285.878,
        "text": "Standard usb connection, two buttons, and a scroll wheel."
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 286.82800000000003,
        "end": 290.128,
        "text": "Fine; that's all I need; I'll take it."
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 291.178,
        "end": 296.32800000000003,
        "text": "Would you like a mouse pad along with it? This plain one is ninety nine rupees extra."
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 297.628,
        "end": 302.278,
        "text": "No, thanks; I already have one at my desk."
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 304.678,
        "end": 309.576,
        "text": "Sure, only the mouse. Four hundred forty nine total. CARD OR u p i?"
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 310.076,
        "end": 312.676,
        "text": "u p i I'll scan this code here?"
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 313.526,
        "end": 318.37600000000003,
        "text": "Yes, that one-payment received, sir-here's your mouse and bill."
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 319.62600000000003,
        "end": 323.12600000000003,
        "text": "Thank you. Let me leave before the rain starts again."
      }
    ],
